R1 R1 R A R1 D D D
@shot fly-sinaloa
A A A
@shot sinaloa-arrival
# LOAN: borrow the most the lender allows
R R A
@shot lender-sinaloa
A Y
@shot borrow-dial
A
@shot borrowed
B
# buy as much Acid as the cash allows
R1 D D D D A Y A
